# Intermediate rows for the five-product right expression

Four literal lists propose BA, TB, UB and HA. The additive intermediates
T = A + BA, U = TB + BA and H = 1 + B + T + UB are defined by packed XOR.
The final product is HA * B. Every product requires a Lean proof.
See `../../source/README.md` for ATLAS attribution and conventions.
